  "description": "MSBuild only, no binaries. Owns the Autodesk product year tables: year to release series, year to target framework, and the A21..A27 / ACADnnnn_OR_GREATER / C3Dnnnn_OR_GREATER preprocessor symbols. Accepts BritechCadYear, Year, CADVersion, CADTrimVersion or a configuration name ending in A21..A27, so both existing repositories keep their current invocation style. Also guards against an Autodesk assembly being copied into build output (BTK1014).",
